+ * `docs/review/responses/a7a-lanes-landing.md` §9): the learner opens the B♭ minor walking item's chart and plays the
+ * form with nothing pressed, no *Count off ▶*, so no click, no count-in and no tracker. The cell still reads every
+ * note, but only `onBeat` moves the bar, so without the clock the chart stays on bar 1 and judges what is held
+ * against bar 1's chord all the way through: a right chord in bar 5 reads no, and bar 5's own cell never answers.
